    {
      "name": "作品说明",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "about-panel",
      "description": "可关闭的暖纸说明层；来源、作品边界和键盘信息在这里阅读。",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-about\" aria-label=\"关于作品\"><button class=\"ds-close\" aria-label=\"关闭作品说明\">关闭</button><h2>一张照片的背面</h2><p>桌上的蓝杯，藏着一个还没出发的假期。转过去，给自己留一点休息的时间。</p><p>这是基于你提供的工位照片制作的交互样片。正面保留原照片细节，未拍到的空间由三维场景补建。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-about{font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;width:min(380px,calc(100vw - 48px));padding:30px;background:#f0eee5;color:#263437;box-shadow:0 16px 45px #0005;border-radius:4px}.ds-about h2{font-family:\"Songti SC\",serif;font-size:27px;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0 24px}.ds-about p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#455251}.ds-close{font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;display:block;margin-left:auto;border:0;background:none;color:#455251;font-size:11px;padding:5px;cursor:pointer}.ds-close:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #a9bcff;outline-offset:6px;}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-about{padding:24px}}"
